This image is built on the Aztec node image (azteclabs/aztec, https://github.com/AztecProtocol/aztec-packages)
by Aztec Labs, Apache License 2.0, unmodified. The page service only starts the node's own
command (`aztec start --network mainnet --node [--sequencer]`) and its key tool
(`aztec validator-keys new`), and uses the viem library that ships in that image.

When the beacon node does not keep every blob, the node fetches them from the free Blobscan API
(https://api.blobscan.com), as Dappnode's Aztec package does.

Dappnode's Aztec package (https://github.com/dappnode/DAppNodePackage-aztec-generic,
Apache License 2.0, Copyright DAppNode Association) was used as a reference for the node's
settings (endpoints, ports, the Blobscan fallback, the keystore folder). No code or files were
copied from it.

The page styles (theme.css, base.css, style.css) come from the AVADO Admin, AVADO Care,
AVADO AI Connect and AVADO Starknet Validator pages.
